      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260730/202607302322472304.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260730/202607302322472304_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260730/202607302322472304_720.jpg"> </div><p>【欧足联反对FIFA提案】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-30/6a6b6a0739026native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">抵制世界杯！欧足联官方：若不废除卖股份提案，将拒参加FIFA赛事</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_180128/5a6db1013e82b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_180128/5a6db1013e82b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_180128/5a6db1013e82b.jpg"> </div><p>欧足联就FIFA成立商业子公司、出售相关股份一事发表声明，宣布只要该提案仍然存在，全部55个会员协会将抵制所有国际足联赛事。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6ba16725886native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">中北美足联官方：全部41个成员协会经过讨论，一致否决FIFA提案</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310310412140.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310310412140_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310310412140_720.jpg"> </div><p>就此前FIFA公布的世界杯商业化提案，继欧足联强烈的反对声明后，中北美足联也发布了联合声明。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6ba5d4f1771native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：欧洲55队+中北美41队反对，因凡蒂诺计划已经彻底失败了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg"> </div><p>欧足联、中北美足联先后就FIFA的世界杯商业化提案表达反对态度，名记Henry Winter发文，表示因凡蒂诺的计划实质上已经失败了。</p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/match2122655date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">友尽赛！拜仁多点开花15-0大胜罗塔埃根 四人双响17岁阿索莫建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260731/202607310157274235.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260731/202607310157274235.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260731/202607310157274235.jpg"> </div><p>季前赛对阵，拜仁15-0狂胜低级别球队罗塔埃根，拜仁多点开花，半场时就6-0领先，下半场拜仁进一步发力，比赛最终以夸张的15-0完场。</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6bb1ecb37banative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">1米94支点就位！官方：皇马签下21岁前锋埃斯皮 支付2500万解约金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310456002109.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310456002109.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310456002109.jpg"> </div><p>莱万特发布官方公告，两家俱乐部已经就埃斯皮的转会达成协议！随后皇马官宣球员加盟，并确认球员将签下一份5年合同。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b6e5173a29native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：国米免签32岁前曼城功勋后卫斯通斯，签约至2028年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310202347514.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310202347514_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310202347514_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，32岁前曼城后卫斯通斯自由身加盟国际米兰，签约至2028年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6bb7ad93a69native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">比HWG还快！皇马凌晨0:16与埃斯皮传绯闻，4:15分直接官宣</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/6a6b9a30db17a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/6a6b9a30db17a_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/6a6b9a30db17a_720.jpg"> </div><p>凌晨0:16，记者Ramón Álvarez爆料皇马有意埃斯皮。4点15分，莱万特、皇马先后发表公告，已就埃斯皮转会达协议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b93fa85e20native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：阿森纳谈判吉马良斯进入深度阶段，交易预计超8000万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ee374225ea_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ee374225ea.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ee374225ea.jpg"> </div><p>比利时记者Sacha Tavolieri消息，阿森纳与纽卡就吉马良斯的转会谈判进入深度阶段。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6bbbdd00654native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：曼城为门将鲁利报价200万欧，马赛要价350万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250917/68c9de31b94fd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250917/68c9de31b94fd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250917/68c9de31b94fd.jpg"> </div><p>记者Santi Aouna报道，曼城为阿根廷门将鲁利报价200万欧元，但马赛希望得到350万欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b80cb729b4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德天空：曼城对罗德里要价7500万欧，皇马与曼城正在进行直接谈判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg"> </div><p>德天空消息，曼城与皇马直接正在就罗德里的转会进行直接谈判，曼城要价7500万欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b7eb61c66cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：雅伊斯勒将出任纽卡新帅，双方达口头协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310042097599_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310042097599_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310042097599_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以here we go确认，雅伊斯勒将出任纽卡新帅，双方达口头协议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6bad90d166enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">名记：卡里克接受拉什福德重新入队，莱奥主动找上曼联但成本太高</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250204/67a2168349bc1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250204/67a2168349bc1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250204/67a2168349bc1.jpg"> </div><p>《曼联看台》节目专访转会专家、记者本·雅各布斯谈到了拉什福德的情况。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b80a3e8c69native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：阿森纳追吉马良斯的进程向好发展，双方越来越接近谈判成功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231016/652cfdf1a623e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231016/652cfdf1a623e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_231016/652cfdf1a623e.jpg"> </div><p>伦敦足球网消息，阿森纳追逐吉马良斯的进程正向好发展。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6bc0291e18enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">杀疯了！皇马今夏请回穆帅+官宣5新援，在谈迪奥曼德、罗德里</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.9" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310521109136_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.9" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.9" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310521109136_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607310521109136_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马今夏请回穆里尼奥，引援动作不断，他们已经官宣5人，分别免签科纳特、免签B席、2000万欧签下邓弗里斯、6000万欧总价签库库雷利亚、2500万欧签下埃斯皮。此外皇马非常接近签下迪奥曼德，同时也在和曼城谈罗德里的转会。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b79ee733a8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">青训工厂！记者：皇马过去6个赛季青训球员转会收入高达4.4亿欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260731/202607310021426326.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260731/202607310021426326.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260731/202607310021426326.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙记者Jose Luis Sanchez指出，过去6个赛季，皇马的青训球员转会收入高达4.4亿欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6b9d032b1b2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">伊劳拉：乔·戈麦斯因肌肉伤势休战数周，确定会错过英超开局阶段</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250901/68b575d498315.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.42" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250901/68b575d498315.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250901/68b575d498315.jpg"> </div><p>伊劳拉在出席新闻发布会时，谈到了上周在热身赛刚开场就受伤离场的本队后卫乔·戈麦斯，后者确认遭遇肌肉伤势，预计休战一个月左右。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-30/6a6b743bbe88cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">暴力行为染红！官方：姆本扎被停赛4场，罚款40000元</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260730/202607302356489572.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260730/202607302356489572_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260730/202607302356489572_720.jpg"> </div><p>中足联官方消息，姆本扎因暴力行为染红被停赛4场，罚款40000元。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;    